{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-returnBarbCave-8600": "NIKOLAI: 就是这里，不知道有没有人在。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-returnBarbCave-8601": "JUNA: 天，这地方真是个破洞，我可真在洞里住过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-returnBarbCave-8602": "BARBARIAN: 别动，奥斯伦人，你们已经被团团包围了，还有看不见的魔法陷阱。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-returnBarbCave-8603": "NIKOLAI: 我们到底为什么要来这里来着？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-returnBarbCave-8604": "CORDELIA: 他们恐怕把自己的陷阱说得太高明了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-returnBarbCave-8605": "????: 那是……普罗赫？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-returnBarbCave-8606": "APINGORIX: 你活着就是为了烦我吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-returnBarbCave-8607": "BARBARIAN: 怎么办，首领？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-returnBarbCave-8608": "????: 叔叔！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-returnBarbCave-8609": "APINGORIX: 嗯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-returnBarbCave-8610": "????: 叔叔，别伤害他，他就是我跟你说的那个人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-returnBarbCave-8611": "APINGORIX: 他？尼古拉·普罗赫？你确定？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-returnBarbCave-8612": "APINGORIX: 奥斯伦人都长一个样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-returnBarbCave-8613": "????: 叔叔，你总是不信我！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-returnBarbCave-8614": "????: 我认得他的声音，他还带着记忆魔像，我们见过他逃出斯特拉尔。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-returnBarbCave-8615": "NIKOLAI: 也不能算是“逃”。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-returnBarbCave-8616": "????: 让他进来吧，他能帮我和爸爸，不会给别人添麻烦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-returnBarbCave-8617": "APINGORIX: 啧……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-returnBarbCave-8618": "APINGORIX: 行吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-ch11barbGate-8619": "BARBARIAN: 首领让我们退后，把守这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-ch11barbGate-8620": "BARBARIAN: 可以跟西蒙去他父亲的住处，别的地方不准去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-ch11barbExpo-8621": "BARBARIAN: 首领一碰上孩子就没辙，一直都这样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-ch11barbBlockerA-8622": "BARBARIAN: 这边不能走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-ch11barbBlockerB-8623": "BARBARIAN: 走另一边，奥斯伦人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8624": "????: 爸爸！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8625": "DREYFUSS: 怎么了，西蒙？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8626": "SYMON: 是他！我跟你说过的那个人！在斯特拉尔，他想放走我们的邻居。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8627": "DREYFUSS: 这个人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8628": "SYMON: 叔叔刚才也不信。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8629": "DREYFUSS: 不，我相信你，在那座囚营里，他好歹还做了几件好事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8630": "DREYFUSS: （这世上要是还有第二个正直的奥斯伦人，我就把眼镜吃了。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8631": "CORDELIA: 你是这孩子的父亲？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8632": "DREYFUSS: 自从奥斯伦杀害了他的亲生家人，我就是了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8633": "DREYFUSS: 伊纳的孩子，理应有位同族的父亲。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8634": "NIKOLAI: 是齐卡隆用他自己的方式……叫我们来这儿的。你知道为什么吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8635": "SYMON: 爸爸，会不会是祖父母在通过记忆魔像说话？奥斯伦人来之前，他们去过神殿，把记忆托付给了他。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8636": "SYMON: 老人们都知道会发生什么。我的父母……以前的父母，他们不相信。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8637": "DREYFUSS: 或许吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8638": "DREYFUSS: 是的……他体内有数百年的记忆，也许上千年，我能看见其中的编码法术。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8639": "NIKOLAI: 等我们办完事，可以把他送回这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8640": "DREYFUSS: 要是你那趟冒险出了岔子，我们的传承不就跟着毁了？我可不答应。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8641": "DREYFUSS: 我想，我们可以做一点……有限的合作，彼此受益。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8642": "NIKOLAI: 好……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8643": "DREYFUSS: 为了保存我们的文化，记忆魔像被赋予了思考、躲藏[oxfordComma /]乃至反击的能力。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8644": "NIKOLAI: 是，他挺拿手。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8645": "DREYFUSS: 不过，他没有史书里描述的那些装甲和武器。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8646": "DREYFUSS: 想要那些东西——相信我，你们会想要的——就帮我找到我要找的圣祠。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8647": "DREYFUSS: 其实，你们本就该帮忙，好证明自己的同胞不只是穿上木鞋和长袜伪装起来的杀人暴徒。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8648": "NIKOLAI: 你这说服人的本事，还得练练。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8649": "SYMON: 还有谁能像你们这样帮我们？你们有奥斯伦那种会飞的船。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8650": "CORDELIA: 具体需要做什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8651": "DREYFUSS: 有座重要的伊纳圣祠，失落了一百五十多年，也正因无人能找到，它几乎肯定还完好无损。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8652": "NIKOLAI: 要我们找到它？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8653": "DREYFUSS: 凭你那点学问还远远不够，你们只管找来能提供线索的文献，圣祠的位置由我来推断。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8654": "DREYFUSS: 首先得拿到伊纳圣典，因为隐藏圣祠的法术与其中某些章节的经文相连，必须知道确切的字句。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8655": "DREYFUSS: 奥斯伦和卢斯基亚把找得到的都烧了，连我那本也没放过，所以你们得动动脑筋。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8656": "SYMON: 斯特拉尔的神殿呢？那里应该还有不少。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8657": "DREYFUSS: 好主意，乖孩子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussReintro-8658": "DREYFUSS: 不过，卢斯基亚已经占领那座城，奥斯伦人，你还是得像往常一样想办法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-stralGuardOfficer-8659": "OFFICER: 没有卢斯基亚护照，不准进入其领土。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-stralGuardOfficer-8660": "NIKOLAI: （还有条路能进去，走地下河。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-stralGuardOfficer-8661": "NIKOLAI: （入口应该在城的西南边。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-stralGuardOfficer-8662": "OFFICER: 等等，我认得你，你是那个外交官，我在报纸上见过你的照片。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-stralGuardOfficer-8663": "NIKOLAI: 我们正在调查一桩……刑事案件。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-stralGuardOfficer-8664": "NIKOLAI: 案子发生在国外，不过城里可能有人知道作案者的情况。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-stralGuardOfficer-8665": "OFFICER: 嗯，听着倒也合理，不过需要办理的文书手续非常多。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-stralGuardOfficer-8666": "OFFICER: 交一笔入境加急费，我们可以免掉一部分手续。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-stralGuardOfficer-8667": "NIKOLAI: ……多少？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-stralGuardOfficer-8668": "OFFICER: 你看，要办的手续可不少啊。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-stralGuardOfficer-8669": "OFFICER: 三百。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-stralGuardOfficer-8670": "NIKOLAI: 你还真不肯吃亏。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-stralGuardOfficer-8671": "OFFICER: 只能在城南活动，那里的大型工程已经完成。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-stralGuardOfficer-8672": "OFFICER: 要是不够，那就不关我的事了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-stralGuardOfficer-8673": "NIKOLAI: （可以进城查那个不知名的法师，但去伊纳神殿还得另找条路。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-stralGuardOfficer-8674": "NIKOLAI: （能走地下河，入口应该在城的西南边。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-stralGuardOfficer-8675": "NIKOLAI: （趁上头还没听到风声，赶紧打听。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-zrodFarmWoman-8676": "WOMAN: 卢斯基亚人总算准我们出门了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-zrodFarmWoman-8677": "WOMAN: 还怕庄稼烂在地里，或者被杂草埋了呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-zrodFarmMan-8678": "MAN: （别担心这家伙，他是来收贿赂的，不是来找麻烦的。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-zrodSoldier-8679": "SOLDIER: 滚。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-zrodActivation-8680": "NIKOLAI: 当初我们就是从这里逃出斯特拉尔的。应该直通神殿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-zrodActivation-8681": "NIKOLAI: 居然没增派巡逻，有点怪……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-zrodActivation-8682": "CORDELIA: 哦？不如用个简单的显形术看看。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-zrodActivation-8683": "CORDELIA: 嗯，谈不上“牢固”，不过这里确实有东西。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-zrodActivation-8684": "NIKOLAI: 它在时隐时现？还是幻象？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-zrodActivation-8685": "CORDELIA: 不，看起来真是故障。结界和其他持续性的魔法，都需要能量来源。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-zrodActivation-8686": "CORDELIA: 这一处的能量来源，或许已经不堪负荷了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-zrodActivation-8687": "NIKOLAI: 那就别在它启动时踩进去，不然他们立刻就会加强戒备。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-zrodloCatch1-8688": "VOICE: 有入侵者！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-zrodloCatch2-8689": "VOICE: 有入侵者！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-symonAfter-8690": "SYMON: 别担心，爸爸真要讨厌你，连话都不会跟你说。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-ch11dreyfussA-8691": "DREYFUSS: 还缺这么多书，真是可悲。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-zWaterMan-8692": "MAN: 哦，你好！你们不是本地人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-zWaterMan-8693": "MAN: 不过放心，这里没人会向卢斯基亚人告密。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-zWaterWoman-8694": "WOMAN: 卢斯基亚人还没修好水管，我们只能来这里取水。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-zRiverBoy-8695": "BOY: 我要钓条鱼当晚饭！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-zWaterMan2-8696": "OLD MAN: 留神，别在人家洗澡的下游打水。更别说还有比洗澡更脏的事！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-zWaterWoman2-8697": "WOMAN: 溪水得煮开了，才能放心喝。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-zWaterWoman2-8698": "WOMAN: 幸好，到处都是被毁的房子，拆下来就能当柴烧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-zLazy-8699": "MAN: 我是在躲劳役队，给卢斯基亚人搬军火，对我有什么好处？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-ch11stralSealed-8700": "被钉死了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-scriptures11-8701": "NIKOLAI: 好吧。这本？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-scriptures11-8702": "NIKOLAI: 你哪怕给点回应，也能省我不少事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-scriptures11-8703": "CORDELIA: 让我看看？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-scriptures11-8704": "NIKOLAI: 你读得懂？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-scriptures11-8705": "CORDELIA: 要是能就好了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-scriptures11-8706": "CORDELIA: 这是一本注疏。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-scriptures11-8707": "CORDELIA: 正文我读不懂。不过你看，相对的两页使用不同语言，又有一套编号让它们彼此对应。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-scriptures11-8708": "CORDELIA: 这本应该就是圣典，交给那位法师。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-scriptures11-8709": "CORDELIA: 另一本，我们留在大学图书馆保存。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-scriptures11-8710": "NIKOLAI: 走吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussBookDeposit1-8711": "NIKOLAI: 是这本书吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussBookDeposit1-8712": "DREYFUSS: 正是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussBookDeposit1-8713": "DREYFUSS: 现在，你可以开始背诵诫命了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussBookDeposit1-8714": "SYMON: 爸爸……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussBookDeposit1-8715": "DREYFUSS: 我们每个人成年前都得背，你也不例外。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussBookDeposit1-8716": "DREYFUSS: 同时，还有两本书要找。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussBookDeposit1-8717": "DREYFUSS: 下一本，应该记载了我们要解开的法术的具体结构。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussBookDeposit1-8718": "DREYFUSS: 伊纳魔法典籍遭到的焚毁比我们的圣典还严重，已经一个多世纪没再发现过成批保存的藏书了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussBookDeposit1-8719": "DREYFUSS: 不过，首领跟你们交过手的那座旧图书馆里，我怀疑还藏着一些。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussBookDeposit1-8720": "NIKOLAI: 档案馆？那里面的书可多了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussBookDeposit1-8721": "DREYFUSS: 正是，所以我会亲自跟去，辨认我们要的那本，要是全靠你们自己，那就别指望找到了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussBookDeposit1-8722": "SYMON: 那我能跟叔叔待在一起吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussBookDeposit1-8723": "DREYFUSS: 虽然我很不乐意，他太惯着你了，但愿我们很快回来，能看见你在用功。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussBookDeposit1-8724": "DREYFUSS: 走吧，别等他那位“叔叔”为了给他弄糖果，又去打个哨站。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-barbsJoin-8725": "NIKOLAI: 你们在干什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-barbsJoin-8726": "NIKOLAI: 你们在干什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-barbsJoin-8727": "CORDELIA: 这是什么意思？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-barbsJoin-8728": "JEROME: 还有别的事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-barbsJoin-8729": "BEN: 你们这是要去参加聚会？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-barbsJoin-8730": "AGATA: 怎么回事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-barbsJoin-8731": "JUNA: 怎么，我们不小心拿走你们的钥匙了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-barbsJoin-8732": "ALEXANDRA: 呃……有什么需要帮忙的吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-barbsJoin-8733": "APINGORIX: 我们要去抢——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-barbsJoin-8734": "APINGORIX: 咳，去回收档案馆里剩下的宝物。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-barbsJoin-8735": "APINGORIX: 有飞空艇，生意应该好做多了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-barbsJoin-8736": "NIKOLAI: 没有我们，你们可维护不了这艘艇，别动歪脑筋。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-barbsJoin-8737": "NIKOLAI: 没有我们，你们可维护不了这艘艇，别动歪脑筋。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-barbsJoin-8738": "AGATA: 你们抢不走这艘艇。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-barbsJoin-8739": "ALEXANDRA: 我们不在，你们就开不了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-barbsJoin-8740": "CORDELIA: 我敢保证，你这些随从里，没人能让它飞起来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-barbsJoin-8741": "JEROME: 操作这艘艇可不简单，给它配备零件也一样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-barbsJoin-8742": "JUNA: 老兄，当飞空艇艇长，你还差点资格。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-barbsJoin-8743": "BEN: 别乱来，不然大家都得摔成肉泥，当然我除外，我会飘。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-barbsJoin-8744": "APINGORIX: 行行行，我又没想把船据为己有，太费事了，船归你们，能让我跟着赚点钱就行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-barbsJoin-8745": "真好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-salvBarb4-8746": "BARBARIAN: 所以我们要找带金箔的，可又不是为了金子……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-salvBarb5-8747": "BARBARIAN: 这东西不能直接拿走？有魔法的，对吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-salvBarb6-8748": "BARBARIAN: 这些东西大半一碰就成灰。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-salvBarb1-8749": "BARBARIAN: 德雷福斯画了张图，告诉我该找什么样的，可……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-salvBarb2-8750": "BARBARIAN: 他给这罗盘施了法，确实指着什么东西。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-salvBarb3-8751": "BARBARIAN: 有些书能卖的价钱，连首领都不敢信。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-salvBarb7-8752": "BARBARIAN: 这本呢？是完整的吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-salvBarb8-8753": "BARBARIAN: 再往前，情况不太妙。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-salvBarb9-8754": "BARBARIAN: 这像“编年史”吗？编年史长什么样？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-archivesSecretReveal-8755": "DREYFUSS: 就是这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-archivesSecretReveal-8756": "NIKOLAI: 我什么都没看见。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-archivesSecretReveal-8757": "DREYFUSS: 那是当然。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-archivesSecretReveal-8758": "DREYFUSS: 跟上。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-apingorixSalvage-8759": "APINGORIX: 别看我，奥斯伦人，找你的书去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-c11extBarb-8760": "BARBARIAN: 谁能想到，书还能值钱？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-yinishBook-8761": "大部分文字是伊纳语，也夹杂着少量里恩语词句，看起来是一份尚未完成的译稿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-DreyfussWaiting-8762": "DREYFUSS: 有个生物占据了密室，你们得打败它。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-DreyfussWaiting-8763": "NIKOLAI: 你自己怎么不去？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-DreyfussWaiting-8764": "DREYFUSS: 这样如何？这趟任务，你们每杀一头怪物，我就原谅奥斯伦一百条人命的罪过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-DreyfussWaiting-8765": "DREYFUSS: 要赎清全部罪孽，仍得花上十几辈子，不过算个好开头。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-DreyfussWaiting-8766": "DREYFUSS: 去吧，收拾掉那个生物。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-secretLiganti-8767": "DREYFUSS: 这个书架看着有戏。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-secretLiganti-8768": "NIKOLAI: 这到底是什么地方？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-secretLiganti-8769": "DREYFUSS: 密室。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-secretLiganti-8770": "DREYFUSS: 数百年来，我的族人被禁锢在各种狭小的隔离区里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-secretLiganti-8771": "DREYFUSS: 为了摆脱这种空间限制，我们创造了相应的法术：外面的占地不变，房间里面却能变得更大。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-secretLiganti-8772": "CORDELIA: 真奇妙，那么那些传说都是真的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-secretLiganti-8773": "DREYFUSS: 当然是真的，伊纳学者从不夸大……除非在抱怨饭菜或自己的身体。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-secretLiganti-8774": "DREYFUSS: 找到了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-secretLiganti-8775": "DREYFUSS: 哦，里面有不少我还不知道的东西，太好了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-secretLiganti-8776": "DREYFUSS: 这里的事办完了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-symonSalvage-8777": "SYMON: 爸爸，太刺激啦！而且是好玩的那种，完全不吓人！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussLastBookBrief-8778": "DREYFUSS: 最后那本书，圣祠以外恐怕已经找不到了，因此得找一份能够替代它的资料。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussLastBookBrief-8779": "DREYFUSS: 要破解隐藏圣祠的法术，必须知道曾在那里任职的司祭姓什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussLastBookBrief-8780": "DREYFUSS: 要是有伊纳族谱就最合适了，可那些族谱也被奥斯伦人和卢斯基亚人全烧了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussLastBookBrief-8781": "CORDELIA: 穆尔的《伊纳民族志》如何？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussLastBookBrief-8782": "DREYFUSS: 那是……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussLastBookBrief-8783": "CORDELIA: 韦斯利·穆尔上尉参加过对抗科尔辛的战争，但本职是一位语言学家和历史学家。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussLastBookBrief-8784": "CORDELIA: 游历期间，他访问了大陆各地伊纳社区的领袖。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussLastBookBrief-8785": "DREYFUSS: 大概是为了日后好把他们一网打尽。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussLastBookBrief-8786": "DREYFUSS: 不过，要真有这本书，也许用得上。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussLastBookBrief-8787": "CORDELIA: 存本稀少，又很古老，但莱奥尼亚的大学里一定有一本。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-zrodloCatchA-8788": "VOICE: 有入侵者！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-zrodloCatchB-8789": "VOICE: 有入侵者！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-zrodloAllkill1-8790": "CORDELIA: 那一定是结界法术的供能通道。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-zrodBackup1-8791": "那一处不会熄灭，得另找条路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-zrodBackup2-8792": "那一处不会熄灭，得另找条路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwell-8793": "HARWELL: 记住，八个书架，每个都有一本放错位置的书。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwell-8794": "HARWELL: 都找完了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwell-8795": "没有。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwell-8796": "是的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwell-8797": "HARWELL: 有什么事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestGive-8798": "HARWELL: 什么？你们在找穆尔的《民族志》？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestGive-8799": "HARWELL: 你们运气不错……也只能算不错吧。我们确实有一本，兴许还是整个王国仅存的完本。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestGive-8800": "HARWELL: 只是这本书跟馆里其他珍本一样，学者们看得可紧了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestGive-8801": "NIKOLAI: 所以……该找谁谈？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestGive-8802": "NIKOLAI: 所以……该找谁谈？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestGive-8803": "ALEXANDRA: 我可以好好求求他们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestGive-8804": "JEROME: 具体是哪位学者？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestGive-8805": "CORDELIA: 想必我能和他们商量妥当吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestGive-8806": "AGATA: 我很会说服人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestGive-8807": "BEN: 放心，谁拿着，我就送他些拿手的蜜糖千层酥，没人抗拒得了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestGive-8808": "JUNA: 我去求也不行？人们听见我开口要东西，通常都会吓一跳。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestGive-8809": "HARWELL: 啊，问题是，他们护书的办法往往更……狡猾，通常会故意把书放错架子，让别人找不到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestGive-8810": "HARWELL: 要是哪个笨手笨脚的低年级生这样做，我的分类法术立刻就能察觉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestGive-8811": "HARWELL: 可教授和研究员不同，他们总能稍稍扭曲分类法术，借此守住自己的“领地”。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestGive-8812": "HARWELL: 只要你们亲手把这些放错的书理出来，我的法术就能找到穆尔那本书，它很小，多半被藏进了另一本书里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestGive-8813": "NIKOLAI: 怎么整理？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestGive-8814": "NIKOLAI: 怎么整理？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestGive-8815": "ALEXANDRA: 好，要怎么做？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestGive-8816": "JEROME: 按什么方式整理？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestGive-8817": "CORDELIA: 翻找这些大部头？非做不可的话……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestGive-8818": "AGATA: 你要我们做什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestGive-8819": "BEN: 行，整理书，绝对是我的拿手好戏……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestGive-8820": "JUNA: 等等，你要我们做什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestGive-8821": "HARWELL: 每个书架顶部都标有类别，找出不该归在该类的书，取下来就够了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestGive-8822": "HARWELL: 我还得盯着这些新来的人，免得哪个自以为是的贵族顺走藏书。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellDebug-8823": "KERAUNOS: 要我跳过整理书籍的小游戏吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellDebug-8824": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellDebug-8825": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-libStudentD-8826": "WOMAN: 哎，乱成这样，真让人以为这房间挨过炸弹。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-libStudentB-8827": "YOUNG WOMAN: 居然还没多少学生回来，真意外。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-libStudentA-8828": "YOUNG WOMAN: 唉……不管那个扑灭大火的法术是什么，它可没顾上宿舍。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-libStudentC-8829": "YOUNG MAN: 有军旅经历或战斗魔法背景的人，政府都愿意委以要职。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-libStudentC-8830": "YOUNG MAN: 所以我改走这条路了，没再像父亲那样去学法律。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-libLounger-8831": "WOMAN: 我家出资捐助这座图书馆，看到它在大火中安然无恙，我很高兴。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-libOfficer-8832": "SERGEANT: 所以……对付燃烧武器和火炮的结界，早就有了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-libTutor-8833": "TUTOR: 当然有！人们用魔法打仗，都打了多少年了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestComplete-8834": "HARWELL: 都好了？让我看看。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestComplete-8835": "HARWELL: 啊，那里有点小动静。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestComplete-8836": "HARWELL: 哼，藏在斯洛普茅斯《第六幻想曲》的初版里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellQuestComplete-8837": "HARWELL: 务必完好归还。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-harwellLater-8838": "HARWELL: 别告诉我，你们已经把穆尔的专著弄丢了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussAirshipP-8839": "DREYFUSS: 得找个战争以外的用途，不然就不洁了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-apingorixAirshipP-8840": "APINGORIX: 把这儿收拾收拾，我住过的山洞都比这舒服。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-symonAirshipP-8841": "SYMON: 我能在这个基础上再造点东西吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-barbAirshipP1-8842": "BARBARIAN: 跑得快是好，可得不停嚼草药，才不至于晕船。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-barbAirshipP2-8843": "BARBARIAN: 活得像奴隶，船倒是造得真好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussGenealogy-8844": "DREYFUSS: 找到了什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussGenealogy-8845": "CORDELIA: 找到了《民族志》，不过全是莱奥尼亚语。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussGenealogy-8846": "CORDELIA: 我注意到，齐卡隆的翻译魔法对文字不起作用。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussGenealogy-8847": "DREYFUSS: 和奥斯伦语用同一套字母，我只需找专名和日期。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussGenealogy-8848": "DREYFUSS: 一百三十八年前……奥尔巴赫……辛茨海姆，不，肯定不是他。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussGenealogy-8849": "DREYFUSS: 啊！就是这位，原圣祠的司祭，伊西多尔·科布伦茨。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussGenealogy-8850": "DREYFUSS: 他姓名首字母对应的秘数，应该是……对……那经文就是……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussGenealogy-8851": "DREYFUSS: 好了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussGenealogy-8852": "NIKOLAI: 你做了什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussGenealogy-8853": "DREYFUSS: 刚才的法术，应该能让我们看见隐藏圣祠的入口。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussGenealogy-8854": "NIKOLAI: 好，太好了，它在哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussGenealogy-8855": "DREYFUSS: 不知道，你们那位“民族志学者”访问的人，没有透露圣祠的位置。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussGenealogy-8856": "DREYFUSS: 不过，圣祠一定在某座大城附近，步行就能到，否则信众就没法遵守我们的教律。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussGenealogy-8857": "NIKOLAI: 这也没缩小多少范围啊。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussGenealogy-8858": "DREYFUSS: 哎哟，瞧把你累的，你的飞空艇也会累吗？那可真辛苦啊。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussGenealogy-8859": "DREYFUSS: 圣祠入口开凿在山壁上，那向来是最安全的藏身处。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene1-8860": "DREYFUSS: 肯定就是我们要找的圣祠。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene1-8861": "DREYFUSS: 前面那道门后有个守卫，守的是至圣所。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene1-8862": "DREYFUSS: 可惜，不知道当初赋予它生命的确切咒语，就无法命令它停手。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene1-8863": "DREYFUSS: 你们得制服它。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene1-8864": "NIKOLAI: 还有什么惊喜该提前说说？蛇坑？喷火机关？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene1-8865": "DREYFUSS: 我倒希望有。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene1-8866": "DREYFUSS: 好了……去吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8867": "DREYFUSS: 干得好，可惜了那个魔像，不过以后也许能修。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8868": "DREYFUSS: 劳驾，让一让。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8869": "NIKOLAI: 要把齐卡隆的记忆取出来吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8870": "DREYFUSS: 这件事他自己会完成，我们刚跨过门槛，那道法术就已经开始运作了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8871": "DREYFUSS: 齐卡隆的记忆副本很快就会保存在这里，留待我们的族人日后找到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8872": "DREYFUSS: 有些宗教仪式，只能在至圣所里举行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8873": "DREYFUSS: 你们这些外族人，都得在外面等。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8874": "NIKOLAI: 这一切发生时，你……有什么感觉吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8875": "ALEXANDRA: 呃……你好？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8876": "WOMAN: 你好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8877": "WOMAN: 啊，齐卡隆，这么多年过去他还在，真好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8878": "WOMAN: 再过一百年……一千年，他大概也还会在。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8879": "CORDELIA: 你从哪里来？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8880": "WOMAN: 从过去，亲爱的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8881": "WOMAN: 很久以前，我住在离这里不远的一座美丽乡间宅邸。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8882": "我父亲是银行家，是我们族人中最早获准在伊纳区外置地的人之一。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8883": "我和姐姐长大时，完全不知道隔离区里的同胞过着怎样的日子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8884": "姐姐十七岁时，甚至获准正式进入社交界。那本该是一场盛大的晚宴……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8885": "可宾客刚开始到场，一群暴徒就闯了进来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8886": "他们抢走或毁掉父亲的一切，而他那些“朋友”只站在一旁。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8887": "我跑开，藏了起来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8888": "WOMAN: 我听见他们把姐姐拖走，可即使那样，她也没喊我的名字，没有暴露我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8889": "WOMAN: 我再也没见过她，也没见过父亲。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8890": "那晚，我走在路上，看见城中四处燃起大火。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8891": "我们的族人正被赶出家园，一如往昔。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8892": "我和其他幸存者一起避难。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8893": "他们带我来到圣祠，见齐卡隆。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8894": "我把记忆托付给他，是想让族人知道：我们也曾有过自由的时候。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8895": "曾有过一段美好、灿烂的时光，我们活得如同王侯。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8896": "第二天，幸存者动身前往斯特拉尔，许多人在那里有亲戚。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8897": "我留给齐卡隆的记忆，就到这里为止。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8898": "ALEXANDRA: 等等……她后来怎么样了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8899": "NIKOLAI: 她活下来了吗？被暴徒抓住了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8900": "DREYFUSS: 经历漫长艰辛的旅程，她抵达了斯特拉尔。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8901": "NIKOLAI: 你怎么知道？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8902": "DREYFUSS: 她叫拉结，是我的曾祖母。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineScene2-8903": "DREYFUSS: 这里的事都办完了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-ch11ZikaronSt-8904": "ZIKARON: ……看……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-ch11ZikaronSt-8905": "ALEXANDRA: 我……看见了些东西。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-ch11ZikaronSt-8906": "ALEXANDRA: 是那个蛮族，阿杏子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-ch11ZikaronSt-8907": "ALEXANDRA: 那是他的藏身处？你要去那里做什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-ch11ZikaronSt-8908": "ALEXANDRA: 他想让我们找到阿平戈里克斯的藏身处。有事要办。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-ch11ZikaronSt-8909": "ALEXANDRA: 应该得把找到的书，交给那位德雷福斯。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-ch11ZikaronSt-8910": "ALEXANDRA: 看来继续跟着德雷福斯就行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-ch11ZikaronSt-8911": "ALEXANDRA: 呃，看来得回我们打过那场大战的城市去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-ch11ZikaronSt-8912": "ALEXANDRA: 他说有座圣祠，应该在某个城市附近？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-ch11ZikaronSt-8913": "ALEXANDRA: 齐卡隆，你可真带我们跑了好大一圈。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-barbAirshipP5-8914": "BARBARIAN: 说真的，他做的菜，哪怕是旧鞋我都吃。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-airshopScene-8915": "NIKOLAI: 等等，这是怎么回事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-airshopScene-8916": "NIKOLAI: 你们的事办完了，该下船了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-airshopScene-8917": "APINGORIX: 计划变了，普罗赫。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-airshopScene-8918": "APINGORIX: 坐着你们的船满世界跑，实在很赚钱。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-airshopScene-8919": "APINGORIX: 所以，我们决定在这里开个小店。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-airshopScene-8920": "ALEXANDRA: 这里以前只是个储物间。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-airshopScene-8921": "DREYFUSS: 还记得扩大房间内部的法术吧？哪里都能用。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-airshopScene-8922": "APINGORIX: 我有些东西你们一定很想买，你这笨手笨脚的外行，漏掉的好东西可不少。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-airshopScene-8923": "APINGORIX: 还有我们一路上弄来的其他宝贝。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-airshopScene-8924": "NIKOLAI: （就不能有件事，别越变越离谱吗？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-apingorixAirshop-8925": "APINGORIX: 这个能帮你赚更多钱，然后交给我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-apingorixAirshop-8926": "获得禧年玫瑰！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-apingorixAirshop-8927": "APINGORIX: 那么，要买什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineSymon-8928": "SYMON: 接下来举行仪式后，按照我们的教律，我就成年了，也会获得魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shrineDreyfuss-8929": "DREYFUSS: 去开门吧。往怪物身上扑，你们最擅长。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-airshipShopReveal-8930": "JUNA: 嘿，亚历？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-airshipShopReveal-8931": "JUNA: 那些蛮族怎么又全上船了？不是已经跟他们两清了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-airshipShopReveal-8932": "JUNA: 是不是该有人管管……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-stopZrodolo-8933": "SOLDIER: 喂，你，滚开！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-shopBarbarianReveal-8934": "BARBARIAN: 他怎么……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-apingorixOpensShop-8935": "APINGORIX: 喂，你，有样东西给你看看。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussTalker-8936": "DREYFUSS: 别看我，是西蒙在学做生意。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussTalker-8937": "DREYFUSS: 你是说，连你都有神谕牌？好吧……我可以抽空来一局。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussTalker-8938": "不了，谢谢",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussTalker-8939": "来一局！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussTalker-8940": "DREYFUSS: 哼……运气。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussTalker-8941": "DREYFUSS: 拿着，大概有诅咒。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussTalker-8942": "获得半影战盔！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/zikaronSidequest.yarn-dreyfussTalker-8943": "DREYFUSS: 不出所料。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3456": "Title: 阿平戈里克斯？那个劫掠者？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3457": "Description: 在尼古拉的世界，沿尼巴罗斯山脉东缘寻找阿平戈里克斯的藏身处。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3458": "Title: 那个声音……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3459": "Description: 进入蛮族洞穴，查明声音的主人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3460": "Title: 重返斯特拉尔",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3461": "Description: 设法进入尼巴罗斯山东侧斯特拉尔城的伊纳神殿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3462": "Title: 洞窟物语",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3463": "Description: 返回蛮族洞穴，找德雷福斯。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3464": "Title: 前往档案馆",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3465": "Description: 返回尼古拉世界中、尼巴罗斯山西北方的档案馆。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3466": "Title: 不用再读了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3467": "Description: 跟随德雷福斯离开档案馆。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3468": "Title: 重返校园",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3469": "Description: 前往莱奥尼亚的大学，继续调查。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3470": "Title: 借书的代价",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3471": "Description: 检查八个书架，找出归类错误的书。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3472": "Title: 这下总齐了吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3473": "Description: 返回飞空艇，与德雷福斯会合。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3474": "Title: 隐秘圣祠的传说",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3475": "Description: 寻找隐藏的伊纳圣祠，应该就在一处从大城步行可达的山洞中。"
}
